 "description": "Choose a formation for 7v7 (U8\u2013U10), 9v9 (U11\u2013U12) or 11v11 (U13+), with alternatives and coaching notes. Explicit format takes precedence over age; defaults to balanced 7v7.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
